			"fileName": "BreakpointsView.cpp",
			"wiki": "The Breakpoints view receives an update signal and calls `updateBreakpointsSlot`. This function fetches the complete list of current breakpoints from the debugger backend via `DbgFunctions()->BpRefList()` and repopulates the view, displaying the newly added breakpoint to the user.",
			"cellName": "Software Breakpoint: Breakpoints View Refreshes - BreakpointsView.cpp:L216-579",
			"cellId": "911a072f-087a-42ed-8e95-916f251d0cb8",
