			"fileName": "memory.cpp",
			"wiki": "The debugger core's `MemUpdateMap` function is invoked. It queries all memory pages of the debuggee process using `VirtualQueryEx`, processes PE section information, and identifies special regions like stacks, heaps, PEB, and TEBs.",
