			"fileName": "cmd-memory-operations.cpp",
			"wiki": "The `cbInstrSavedata` command handler is executed. It parses the arguments, reads the specified memory region from the debuggee using `MemReadDumb`, and writes the resulting data to the specified file.",
			"cellName": "Debugger Core: Read Memory and Write to File - cmd-memory-operations.cpp:L176-180",
