		"src/dbg/TraceRecord.cpp-simstep-01a2323d-c09c-4845-b4b0-3d4d10cff928": {
			"path": "src/dbg/TraceRecord.cpp-simstep-01a2323d-c09c-4845-b4b0-3d4d10cff928",
			"fileName": "TraceRecord.cpp",
			"wiki": "When `TraceRecordManager::enableTraceRecording` is called with `enabled=false`, it closes the handle to the trace file, sets the `rtEnabled` flag to false, and logs a message indicating that trace recording has stopped. This concludes the tracing session.",
			"cellName": "Finalize Trace File - TraceRecord.cpp:L569-580",
			"cellId": "27f7e07b-3e40-4651-ba53-2463bb952d1f",
