			"fileName": "plugin_loader.cpp",
			"wiki": "The 'pluginregistercallback' function stores the plugin's handle and function pointer in a global list, 'gPluginCallbackList', indexed by the callback type.",
			"cellName": "Store Callback in Registry - plugin_loader.cpp:L645-654",
			"cellId": "99a1411b-b77e-4865-9156-3660e532cc1f",
