			"fileName": "debugger.cpp",
			"wiki": "The debugger's core handler for process creation, 'cbCreateProcess', prepares a 'PLUG_CB_CREATEPROCESS' struct with event details and then calls 'plugincbcall' to notify all interested plugins.",
